Thumbs.db

# Build/run logs are evidence on the machine, not repository content. Without
# this, the daily job's `git add -A` commits its own stdout every run.
*.log

# The daily loop's own "did it run" record. The editorial archive is the three
# history files; this is operational telemetry and would otherwise produce a
# commit twice a day whether or not anything changed.
data/daily.json

